# Copy to server/.env (git-ignored) and fill in. Real environment variables
# always win over this file (see loadDotEnv in main.go).

# --- SMS: Beem Africa -------------------------------------------------------
# Without both keys the server runs in dev mode: SMS/OTPs are printed to the
# console instead of sent, and the OTP code is a constant.
BEEM_API_KEY=
BEEM_SECRET_KEY=
# Sender ID must be approved on the Beem account. Default: TUKIIO.
BEEM_SENDER_ID=

# Meeting / loan-due reminder SMS (sent daily). Off unless set to 1.
PESABOX_REMINDERS=0

# --- Access -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Comma-separated phone numbers promoted to Super Admin on startup. When empty
# and no Super Admin exists yet, the earliest account is promoted.
SUPER_ADMIN_PHONES=

# --- Branding / server --------------------------------------------------------
# Product name users see (reports, SMS prefix). Default: HelaBox.
BRAND_NAME=
# HTTP port. Default: 8090.
PORT=
